{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00358","headline":"题金华宫 · 蜀太后徐氏","name":"题金华宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"再到金华顶，玄都访道回。\n云披分景象，黛锁显楼台。\n雨涤前山净，风吹去路开。\n翠屏夹流水，何必羡蓬莱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太后徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}